dotengine/godot/issues/71795\n\nEspecially as your responses in the proposal thread indicate that the same solutions solve that problem\n\nSo I'll close this as a duplicate for now and if any further details come up please comment here and we can reopen this if it turns out to be a different issue\n\nThank you for reporting!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3202420296/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3202883219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109653#issuecomment-3202883219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109653","id":3202883219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-6B6T","user":{"login":"Lexyth","id":18605122,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjA1MTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18605122?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth","html_url":"https://github.com/Lexyth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexyth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T23:25:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T23:26:06Z","body":"They do solve it, so it's performance related. However, I'm not sure if it would be solved by general performance improvements for UI menus, since it seems to be specifically coming from pop-ups creating new windows and the performance issues related to window creation. \n\nWhile the other issue thread does mention these window-creation issues, I think it would be better to address them in a dedicated issue thread, since it's not the main focus of the menus thread, just in case the solution for the menus in general doesn't resolve the window creation.\n\nUnless there's another issue that already addresses the window creation. I couldn't find one, but that doesn't mean much.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3202883219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]